9XSFFDSXRuUDRod0pTMURiMXk4Nnc1N1cxTENhZGs?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"Entergy 為谷歌西孟菲斯資料中心項目提交了經過嚴格修改的申請 - 阿肯色州民主黨公報"},{"title":"Google expands partnership with Entergy Arkansas, will fund renewable energy and grid upgrades for West Memphis data center","src":"Data Center Dynamics","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"谷歌擴大與阿肯色州 Entergy 的合作夥伴關係，將為西孟菲斯資料中心的可再生能源和電網升級提供資金"},{"title":"Entergy Arkansas announces enhanced partnership at Google West Memphis campus, delivering at least $500M in new savings for all customers","src":"Entergy","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"Entergy 阿肯色州宣布加強與 Google 西孟菲斯園區的合作夥伴關係，為所有客戶節省至少 5 億美元的費用"}],"themes":[{"name":"資料中心","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"能源/電力","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/65984/000006598426000174/etr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Entergy's business is subject to numerous risks and uncertainties that could affect its ability to successfully implement its business strategy and affect its financial results. Carefully consider all of the information in this report and, in particular, the following principal risks and all of the other specific factors described in Part I, Item 1A of this report, \"Risk Factors,\" before deciding whether to invest in Entergy or the Registrant Subsidiaries.","zh":"Entergy 的業務面臨眾多風險和不確定性，這些風險和不確定性可能會影響其成功實施業務策略的能力並影響其財務表現。在決定是否投資 Entergy 或註冊子公司之前，請仔細考慮本報告中的所有資訊，特別是以下主要風險以及本報告第一部分第 1A 項「風險因素」中所述的所有其他具體因素。"},{"en":"The terms and conditions of service, including electric rates, of the Registrant Subsidiaries are determined through regulatory approval proceedings that can be lengthy and subject to appeal, potentially resulting in lengthy litigation and uncertainty as to ultimate results.","zh":"註冊子公司的服務條款和條件（包括電價）是透過監管審批程序確定的，該程序可能會很漫長並且可能會上訴，可能會導致漫長的訴訟和最終結果的不確定性。"},{"en":"Entergy's business could experience adverse effects related to changes to state or federal legislation or regulation, including increased tariffs, as well as changes to governmental policies and programs, including tax credits, loans, grants, guarantees, and other subsidies, or experience risks associated with participation in the MISO markets and allocation of transmission upgrade costs.","zh":"Entergy 的業務可能會因州或聯邦立法或法規的變化（包括關稅增加）以及政府政策和計劃的變化（包括稅收抵免、貸款、贈款、擔保和其他補貼）而受到不利影響，或者面臨與參與 MISO 市場和分配傳輸升級成本相關的風險。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, the Utility operating companies provided retail electric service to customers in Arkansas, Louisiana, Mississippi, and Texas, as follows:","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，公用事業營運公司向阿肯色州、路易斯安那州、密西西比州和德克薩斯州的客戶提供零售電力服務，具體如下："},{"en":"Prior to the sale of the Entergy New Orleans and Entergy Louisiana natural gas distribution businesses on July 1, 2025, Entergy New Orleans and Entergy Louisiana provided both retail electric and gas service to customers. See \"Dispositions - Natural Gas Distribution Businesses\" in Note 14 to the financial statements for discussion of the sale of the Entergy New Orleans and Entergy Louisiana natural gas distribution businesses.","zh":"在 2025 年 7 月 1 日出售 Entergy New Orleans 和 Entergy Louisiana 天然氣分銷業務之前，Entergy New Orleans 和 Entergy Louisiana 向客戶提供零售電力和天然氣服務。有關出售 Entergy 新奧爾良和 Entergy 路易斯安那天然氣分銷業務的討論，請參閱財務報表附註 14 中的「處置 - 天然氣分銷業務」。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electricity Us Regulated","val":12775314000,"zh":"美國電力監管"},{"name":"Natural Gas Us Regulated","val":112607000,"zh":"天然氣受美國監管"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":58765000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":12946686000}},"peers":["FE","EIX","DTE","EXC","PEG"]}}